  "description": "Change of use from retail (Use Class E) to a restaurant (Use Class E(b)), including the installation of a mechanical extraction and ventilation system to serve the commercial kitchen.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The rating level of noise emitted from the proposed mechanical plant and extraction/ventilation equipment, as assessed under BS 4142:2014 (or any subsequent replacement standard), shall be at least 5dB(A) below the measured background noise level (LA90, 15 minutes) at the façade of the nearest noise-sensitive premises.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The equipment shall thereafter be operated and maintained in accordance with the approved details for the lifetime of the development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reason: To ensure that the development does not give rise to unacceptable noise impacts on neighbouring occupiers, in accordance with London Plan Policy D14 and Hackney Local Plan Policy LP16.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>"
